+// Set when --force-composition was given on the command line. The X11 root property
+// GAMESCOPE_COMPOSITE_FORCE is assigned onto cv_composite_force verbatim, so an external
+// writer can silently cancel a flag the user asked for explicitly. Track the CLI intent
+// separately and let the property write only cv_composite_force itself.
+static bool		bForceCompositionFromCLI = false;
